config BUZZER_NATIVE_SIM
	bool "native_sim software buzzer driver"
	default y
	depends on BUZZER
	help
	  Enable the native_sim buzzer back-end.
	  This drives the PC speaker through the evdev interface
	  (/dev/input/by-path/platform-pcspkr-event-spkr).
	  When the evdev node is unavailable,
	  it falls back to the POSIX terminal bell ('\a' written to stderr).
